@startuml dtb-business-process
!include <archimate/Archimate>
title Business Process — Same-day VND credit transfer (DTB)
caption VCB Architecture Modeling Language — Daily Transaction Banking trainee sample
top to bottom direction

' === Actors and Roles ===
Business_Actor(custActor, "Business Actor BUS.ACT.01\nCustomer")
Business_Role(txRole, "Business Role BUS.ROL.01\nTransfer initiator")

' === Business Services ===
Business_Service(svcInit, "Business Service BUS.SVC.01\nTransfer initiation")
Business_Service(svcGate, "Business Service BUS.SVC.02\nDaily limit enforcement")
Business_Service(svcCore, "Business Service BUS.SVC.03\nInternal credit posting")
Business_Service(svcNapas, "Business Service BUS.SVC.04\nInterbank credit (NAPAS)")
Business_Service(svcInq, "Business Service BUS.SVC.05\nTransfer inquiry")

' === Primary Process Steps ===
Business_Process(procInit, "Business Process BUS.PROC.01\nInitiate transfer")
Business_Process(procValid, "Business Process BUS.PROC.02\nValidate accounts and funds")
Business_Process(procGate, "Business Process BUS.PROC.03\nDaily limit gate\n50M VND AND 10 qty")
Business_Process(procCore, "Business Process BUS.PROC.04\nInternal Core debit and credit")
Business_Process(procNapas, "Business Process BUS.PROC.05\nNAPAS debit and switch 30s")
Business_Process(procHist, "Business Process BUS.PROC.06\nProject history")

' === Business Objects ===
Business_Object(objTx, "Business Object BUS.OBJ.01\nTransfer")
Business_Object(objBucket, "Business Object BUS.OBJ.02\nDailyLimitBucket")
Business_Object(objHist, "Business Object BUS.OBJ.03\nHistoryRecord")

' === Assignment: Actor to Role ===
Rel_Assignment(custActor, txRole, "assignment")

' === Assignment: Role to first process step ===
Rel_Assignment(txRole, procInit, "assignment")

' === Triggering: E2E process flow ===
Rel_Triggering_Down(procInit, procValid, "triggering")
Rel_Triggering_Down(procValid, procGate, "triggering: pass")
Rel_Triggering_Down(procGate, procCore, "triggering: pass + VCB")
Rel_Triggering_Down(procGate, procNapas, "triggering: pass + other bank")
Rel_Triggering_Down(procCore, procHist, "triggering")
Rel_Triggering_Down(procNapas, procHist, "triggering")

' === Access: Process to Business Object ===
Rel_Access(procInit, objTx, "access: write")
Rel_Access(procGate, objBucket, "access: write reserve")
Rel_Access(procHist, objHist, "access: write project")

' === Realization: Process realizes Service ===
Rel_Realization(procInit, svcInit, "realization")
Rel_Realization(procGate, svcGate, "realization")
Rel_Realization(procCore, svcCore, "realization")
Rel_Realization(procNapas, svcNapas, "realization")
Rel_Realization(procHist, svcInq, "realization")

' === Serving: Service serves Role ===
Rel_Serving(svcInit, txRole, "serving")
Rel_Serving(svcGate, txRole, "serving")

legend bottom
  Primary E2E: Initiate → Validate → Gate → Rail choice (Internal / NAPAS) → History.
  Gate runs BEFORE rail. NAPAS timeout after debit → reverse + immediate release → Failed.
  Inquiry is a second process (BUS.PROC.07), not shown here for clarity.
  One product, two rails. Teaching diagram — redraw in Archi for the dossier.
endlegend
@enduml
